    {
      "id": "qtm-m5-worked-examples-c2",
      "heading": "Battery life: p-value and decision",
      "explanation_md": "**Step 3: p-value.** The test is left-tailed with z = −2.0, and the slide gives **p ≈ 0.0228**.\n\n**Step 4: Decision.** **p = 0.0228 < α = 0.05**, so **reject H0**.\n\n**Conclusion:** there is **evidence that battery life is less than claimed**.\n\nThis is the p-value rule in action: p is below α, so H0 goes.",
      "example_ids": [
        "qtm-ex-m5-battery-life"
      ],
      "key_terms": [],
      "exam_line": "Battery: left-tailed, z = −2.0, p ≈ 0.0228 < 0.05, so reject H0; battery life is less than claimed.",
